## Part A — Main Report section (required)

Approximately three paragraphs and one figure. This is what appears in the body of D001.

### [Organization Name]

**Deliverable(s):** [CFP role identifier(s) and tracker identifier(s)]

#### Overview — approximately one paragraph

What you built and why, and how it fits the pilot. Name the workflow, service or register you
worked on, and say what a reader would see if they went and looked at it.

#### Challenges — approximately one paragraph

The main obstacles. This is the paragraph most likely to be quoted in the Report's findings, so
be specific: what blocked you, what you tried, and whether it was resolved. Problems with tooling,
with the Building Blocks methodology, with the standards themselves, or with things that turned
out to be underspecified are all in scope.

#### Future work — approximately one paragraph

What you would do next, and what you think the initiative or OGC should take forward.

#### Figure

One figure — an architecture diagram, a data flow, a provenance graph, a screenshot of a working
interface. Supply it as a separate image file (PNG or SVG) with a one-line caption. If you have no
figure, say so; it is not a blocker.
